### Get banks
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/banks

### Transfer
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/banks/1/accounts/1100/transfer
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: transfer-1111-1100-006

{
  "destinationBankId": 1,
  "destinationAccountNumber": "1111",
  "amount": 2000
}

### Create account
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/banks/1/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ownerName": "Sanad",
  "accountNumber": "1111",
  "accountType": "CURRENT"
}

### Delete bank
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/banks/3

### Delete account
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/banks/1/accounts/777001

### Deposit
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/banks/1/accounts/1111/deposit
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: deposit-1111-001

{
  "amount" : 5000.00
}

